sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServe as KServe Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant VLLM as vllm-gaudi Container<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant HPU as Intel Gaudi HPU<br/>PCIe/HCCL
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>S3/PVC/HF Hub
    participant Worker as HPUWorker Peer<br/>HCCL

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>KServe: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: OIDC/Bearer
    KServe->>Istio: Route to pod<br/>Auth validated
    Istio->>VLLM: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000, mesh-internal
    VLLM->>HPU: Submit inference batch<br/>PCIe DMA
    HPU-->>VLLM: Inference result
    VLLM-->>Istio: JSON response
    Istio-->>KServe: Forward response
    KServe-->>Client: HTTPS response<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Note over VLLM,Storage: Flow 2: Model Loading at Startup

    VLLM->>Storage: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: IAM/HF Token
    Storage-->>VLLM: Model artifacts
    VLLM->>HPU: Load weights to device memory<br/>PCIe DMA

    Note over VLLM,Worker: Flow 3: Multi-HPU Distributed Inference

    VLLM->>Worker: Tensor parallel all-reduce<br/>HCCL, no encryption
    Worker-->>VLLM: Partial results<br/>HCCL
    VLLM->>Worker: KV cache transfer<br/>NIXL RDMA/TCP, no encryption
    Worker-->>VLLM: Prefill KV data
